                    "message": "Why `rc` initialization is in the middle of a statement?\n```\nfor (struct related_resource_id_iter res##_iter = ((rc) = 0, related_resource_id_iter_init(&(res##_iter))); <...>\n```\nShouldn't it be something like\n```\nfor ((rc) = 0, struct related_resource_id_iter res##_iter = related_resource_id_iter_init(&(res##_iter)); <...>\n```\n?"
                },
